-- Green Tag: dummy data for training the offices. GENERATED — do not edit;
-- change tools/make-training-seed.mjs and run it again.
--
-- Run in the SQL editor, after training_sandbox.sql. Safe to run again: it
-- clears the training rows first, so running it is also "reset the training
-- data to how it started". Real rows are never touched.
--
-- Everything here is behind the training wall: only training accounts see it.
--
--   1110 trees across 360 barangays of 22 towns:
--     Siniloan: 150 trees, 12 tags
--     Biñan City: 60 trees, 4 tags
--     Cabuyao City: 60 trees, 4 tags
--     Calamba City: 60 trees, 4 tags
--     San Pablo City: 60 trees, 4 tags
--     San Pedro City: 60 trees, 4 tags
--     Santa Rosa City: 60 trees, 4 tags
--     Cavinti: 40 trees, 3 tags
